			"notes": "### Change Log:\n\nAdded a visual indicator for locked items\nLocked items can no longer be crafted\nFixed an issue with potions not locking or unlocking properly\nMessages from the Archipelago server now have proper coloring \nFixed an issue with generating the multiworld where too many items would try to be added\nReplaced the HUD with a build in GUI dashboard\nAdded progressive gifts for armor and tools\nUpdated Archipelago item ids to be more readable \n\nThis is a beta release. Expect rough edges. Bug reports and feedback are welcome.\n\nInstall instructions are found in the [README](https://github.com/CoreyEStinson/MinecraftArchipelago/blob/main/README.md)"
